     ['ข้อใดถูกต้อง?', ['The car that I bought is blue.', 'The car who I bought is blue.', 'The car where I bought is blue.', 'The car whose I bought is blue.'], 'รถเป็นสิ่งของ ใช้ that'],
     ['People _____ exercise regularly are often healthier.', ['who', 'which', 'whose', 'where'], 'ขยายคน ใช้ who'],
